@startuml activity_diagram
title Activity Diagram - Farmer Journey: Finding & Using Crop Cultivation Guide

|Farmer|
start
:Open Mobile App;
|App|
:Check connectivity;
if (Online?) then (yes)
    :Trigger background sync;
    :Fetch latest guides from API;
    :Update offline cache;
else (no)
    :Load from offline cache;
endif
:Display Home Dashboard;
|Farmer|
:Tap "Crop Guides";
|App|
:Show Crop Categories (Cereals, Pulses, Vegetables, etc.);
|Farmer|
:Select Crop Category;
|App|
:Filter crops by category;
:Show Crop List with Seasons;
|Farmer|
:Select Crop (e.g., Wheat) and Season (Rabi);
|App|
:Query guides for crop + season + language;
:Display Guide Variants (Hindi, English, Regional);
|Farmer|
:Select Preferred Language Guide;
|App|
:Load full CropGuide from cache;
:Render Guide Overview;
|Farmer|
fork
    :Browse Growth Stages;
    |App|
    :Show Stage Timeline (Sowing → Harvest);
    |Farmer|
    :Select Specific Stage;
    |App|
    :Display Stage Activities & Warnings;
    :Show Stage-Specific Fertilizers;
    :Show Stage-Specific Pest Alerts;
fork again
    :View Fertilizer Schedule;
    |App|
    :Display Complete Schedule Table;
    :Highlight Current/Upcoming Applications;
    |Farmer|
    :Set Reminder for Next Application;
    |App|
    :Create Local Notification;
fork again
    :Check Pest/Disease Info;
    |App|
    :Show Pest Cards with Images;
    :Display Symptoms & Identification Tips;
    :Show Preventive Measures;
    :Show Curative Treatments (Chemical + Organic);
    |Farmer|
    :Identify Pest in Field;
    :Follow Recommended Treatment;
fork again
    :View Harvest Information;
    |App|
    :Show Yield Expectations;
    :Display Harvest Readiness Indicators;
    :Show Post-Harvest Handling Steps;
fork again
    :Bookmark Guide for Quick Access;
    |App|
    :Save to Farmer's Bookmarks;
    :Confirm with Toast Message;
endfork
|Farmer|
:Apply Knowledge in Field;
|App|
:Log Farmer Action (Analytics);
:Update Last Accessed Timestamp;
stop

@enduml